 "description": "The Saffier SE 33 Life sets a new standard for high-end daysailing. In short, the Saffier SE 33 Life is a luxury sailing yacht which shows in her sailing, comfort and craftsmanship. She has an unmatched sailing experience. The Saffier SE 33 Life is engineered for single-handed sailing in the utmost comfort, with high speeds and easy handling. She is the perfect sailboat to enjoy life with your friends and family especially because of her luxurious cockpit and interior.\nFurthermore, this daysailer its technology is top-notch. The latest hull design and vacuum-built methods provides a stable, light, fast and safe sailing yacht. New smart technology of this luxury daysailer provides the possibility to monitor your boat at all times. In short, the Saffier SE 33 Life creates a new philosophy of high-end daysailing. Sail your favourite waters like never before with this Saffier Yacht.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "D. Hennevanger | Kees van de Stadt"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [
  "European Yacht of the Year"
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "A perfect sailing experience",
   "intro": "The Saffier Se 33 Life is one of the fastest daysailers on the water. From behind the steering wheels you control the Saffier Se 33 Life luxury sailing yacht.\nAll sheets, halyards and trim lines are running under deck back to the helmsman position. Single-handed sailing is the standard for every Saffier Yacht. Furthermore, the sailing experience is like no other sailing yacht.\n\nSpeed, comfort and safety where the pillars up on which the sailing yacht was designed and engineered. All this in combination with the perfect cockpit of the Saffier Se 33 Life, which gives you luxury, comfort and sunbeds to relax prior, during and after your sailing trip. In short, the Saffier SE 33 Life allows you to sail, adventure and relax.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Smart interior layout",
   "intro": "The interior of the Saffier SE 33 Life fulfills all of your wishes for a day out on the water. The cabin provides a luxurious and comfortable retreat from the elements and is a desirable place to come back to.\nBesides that, the Saffier SE 33 life has a cabin that is suited to extend your stay and day out on the water. She has a refined interior that is sophisticated and luxurious.\n\nThe Saffier SE 33 Life has four beds to stay spend the night and a day head with a toilet that is easy accessible. This enables you to lengthen your stay and adventure your favourite waters on this Saffier Yacht. In the small the galley you are able to prepare breakfast, lunch or dinner. The special coffeebar gives you the opportunity to serve a perfect coffee wherever you are. And of course, there is a lot of storage space. Therefore, the Saffier SE 33 Life creates a new standard of high-end daysailing. She enables you to sail and create memorable moments on the water with your loved ones.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "A fine art that is luxury",
   "intro": "Craftsmanship and knowledge are required to create an interior that feels like home and a daysailer that sails perfect. Luxury and comfort are on a Saffier Yacht ensured through the usage of the highest quality materials.\nOur luxury finish is created by selecting the right woods, fabrics and materials. Moreover, it is our renowned craftsmanship that ensures the highest quality sailing yacht. Besides that, all Saffier Yachts can be configured to your desires. This Saffier SE 33 Life takes luxury and comfort to new heights. She is a sailing yacht like no other.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Award winning model",
   "intro": "The Saffier Se 33 Life is an award-winning daysailer that sets new standards in sailing in total comfort in a fast way.\nCrowned European Yacht of the Year, this yacht embodies the perfect balance between sporty sailing and luxurious comfort. Designed for sailors who appreciate responsive handling and fast cruising, the Se 33 Life delivers an exhilarating experience whether you sail solo or with friends.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "In-boom mainsheet",
   "intro": "The German sheeting system runs the mainsheet through the boom, creating a clean look and keeping the cockpit beautifully open.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Gentlemen seats",
   "intro": "The gentlemen seats give the helmsman a comfortable seating while steering the Saffier Se 33 Life across your favourite waters.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Anchor system",
   "intro": "The integrated folding electric anchor sytem gives you the freedom to drop the anchor wherever you like.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Carbon mast",
   "intro": "The carbon fibre mast will be equipped with curved carbon fibre spreaders, carbon fibre boom and carbon fibre rodkick.",
   "items": [],
